  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The tangent at the end points of the focal chord meets at the directrix.</p><p>The equation of the tangent at <math><mi>P</mi></math> is <math> <mrow> <mi>y</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>This tangent intersects the directrix at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
